{"id":"ebaacda55a4991ea","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FmCRow.md","title":"FmCRow","display":"FmCRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FmCRow","parameters":["z23","z24","z25"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FmCRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z23</span><span>z24</span><span>z25</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命题语法。有序参数：<code>z23</code>、<code>z24</code>、<code>z25</code>。</p>\n<p>有限带标签公式。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FmCRow z23 z24 z25)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (and\n    (= z25 t)\n    (or\n      (exists z28 (and (@ Nat z28) (@ PAtom z28 t)))\n      (or\n        (exists z29\n          (and (@ PNeg z29 t) (exists z30 (exists z31 (and (in z30 z24) (and (@ App z23 z30 z31) (= z31 z29)))))))\n        (exists z32\n          (exists z33\n            (and\n              (@ PImp z32 z33 t)\n              (and\n                (exists z34 (exists z35 (and (in z34 z24) (and (@ App z23 z34 z35) (= z35 z32)))))\n                (exists z36 (exists z37 (and (in z36 z24) (and (@ App z23 z36 z37) (= z37 z33)))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1ee75039aeffe56b\" href=\"?note=1ee75039aeffe56b\" title=\"ZFC_PNeg\">PNeg</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FmCRow z23 z24 z25)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nat","status":"resolved","id":"e2136a636857d477","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PAtom","status":"resolved","id":"30627acf823af3c5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PImp","status":"resolved","id":"88931f785a07870f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PNeg","status":"resolved","id":"1ee75039aeffe56b